                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0044d3f9-1824-34dc-b853-ee1282889983",
                        "entry_id": "4fb1768c-edc7-3672-9ee8-022e20ba1f7e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "стремление делать что-либо лучше других и добиваться большего, чем другие, часто сопряжённое с жаждой известности, славы, с любовью к почестям"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4df1727a-709a-4f1f-98b9-2d19cbba795d",
                                "sense_id": "0044d3f9-1824-34dc-b853-ee1282889983",
                                "text": "Он решался жить в Петербурге и рассудил, что для удовлетворения своего тщеславия и честолюбия ему открыты две дороги: служба и большой свет; причём он и не подумал обманывать себя призраками пользы, обязанности или призвания."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "689e2a6b-8239-45ac-b508-6238945a1452",
                        "source_entry_id": "4fb1768c-edc7-3672-9ee8-022e20ba1f7e",
                        "source_sense_id": "0044d3f9-1824-34dc-b853-ee1282889983",
                        "target_lang_word": "ambition",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ambition",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ba72e6d-3908-35e5-ab8a-bad802b34d80",
                                        "entry_id": "a9c29b43-e9ac-3592-8fa3-1788785fb3da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eager or inordinate desire for some object that confers distinction, as preferment, honor, superiority, political power, or fame; desire to distinguish one's self from other people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70b0c8bf-85f2-44f8-91a9-4cdf003bfb9a",
                                                "sense_id": "6ba72e6d-3908-35e5-ab8a-bad802b34d80",
                                                "text": "My daughter, Johanna, wants to be a firefighter very much. She has a lot of ambition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4761de3-2f90-4619-9251-750b02f40ca9",
                                                "sense_id": "6ba72e6d-3908-35e5-ab8a-bad802b34d80",
                                                "text": "The third part of practice hath divers branches, but one principal root in these our times, which is the vast and overspreading ambition and usurpation of the see of Rome; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ec6e23d-263d-477a-9a6d-493cbe92deba",
                                                "sense_id": "6ba72e6d-3908-35e5-ab8a-bad802b34d80",
                                                "text": "One is aſtoniſhed hovv ſuch a ſmall ſpot could furniſh Men ſufficient to ſacrifice to the pitiful Ambition of poſſeſſing five or ſix thouſand more Acres, or tvvo or three more Villages: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e992113-8f85-3e00-a6e0-85cd69285a1a",
                                        "entry_id": "a9c29b43-e9ac-3592-8fa3-1788785fb3da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An object of an ardent desire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5150f59b-53da-4c72-8a5b-4c721f88d56a",
                                                "sense_id": "4e992113-8f85-3e00-a6e0-85cd69285a1a",
                                                "text": "My ambition is to own a helicopter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf75c778-7bad-3a78-b2b5-8d2d936a133b",
                                        "entry_id": "a9c29b43-e9ac-3592-8fa3-1788785fb3da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A desire, as in (sense 1), for another person to achieve these things."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9639a09b-628c-357e-92fd-abb5f24f799e",
                                        "entry_id": "a9c29b43-e9ac-3592-8fa3-1788785fb3da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A personal quality similar to motivation, not necessarily tied to a single goal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2c53ff3-d341-3102-9492-67b3f4099cf2",
                                        "entry_id": "a9c29b43-e9ac-3592-8fa3-1788785fb3da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of going about to solicit or obtain an office, or any other object of desire; canvassing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94d80549-425b-4af8-b26f-c42991495971",
                                                "sense_id": "b2c53ff3-d341-3102-9492-67b3f4099cf2",
                                                "text": "I on th' other ſide / Us'd no ambition to commend my deeds, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "ambition",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79c83e5a-8c20-3f34-8ffb-32ff723b0525",
                                        "entry_id": "a085cfa5-204a-354d-9ab0-0187c777599e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To seek after ambitiously or eagerly; to covet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78f69089-fd76-444b-87be-412a3011595a",
                                                "sense_id": "79c83e5a-8c20-3f34-8ffb-32ff723b0525",
                                                "text": "Pausanias, ambitioning the sovereignty of Greece, bargains with Xerxes for his daughter in marriage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9bd6676f-529a-43db-9994-58ef0f3c4e21",
                        "source_entry_id": "4fb1768c-edc7-3672-9ee8-022e20ba1f7e",
                        "source_sense_id": "0044d3f9-1824-34dc-b853-ee1282889983",
                        "target_lang_word": "status seeking",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dda95f20-6606-4c8a-8fb1-b439e6612ed8",
                        "source_entry_id": "4fb1768c-edc7-3672-9ee8-022e20ba1f7e",
                        "source_sense_id": "0044d3f9-1824-34dc-b853-ee1282889983",
                        "target_lang_word": "Ehrgeiz",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Ehrgeiz",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26f1f9cf-1a06-3237-8ce9-2e8e87342d98",
                                        "entry_id": "e537bdd1-f1ba-3c2a-83d3-44daeb763fb1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "starkes Streben nach Erfolg"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6249bf4-4458-4e64-a4fc-765ff8f5585b",
                                                "sense_id": "26f1f9cf-1a06-3237-8ce9-2e8e87342d98",
                                                "text": "Sein Ehrgeiz war schon krankhaft übertrieben."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab153a22-6e8e-4474-90ae-7b750ef29e94",
                                                "sense_id": "26f1f9cf-1a06-3237-8ce9-2e8e87342d98",
                                                "text": "„Diesen Ehrgeiz weiß Shiffrin gut zu verstecken.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a75196a5-398a-4361-9540-6af44d7de9f4",
                                                "sense_id": "26f1f9cf-1a06-3237-8ce9-2e8e87342d98",
                                                "text": "„Die Aussicht, es könnte ihm Verachtung entgegenschlagen, ließ Darwin erstarren, andererseits brannte er vor Ehrgeiz.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fcbce04-705e-4dcb-9506-040fc8aae2e8",
                                                "sense_id": "26f1f9cf-1a06-3237-8ce9-2e8e87342d98",
                                                "text": "„Da sie sich auf die Gärtnerei verstanden, mußte ihnen auch der Ackerbau gelingen – und der Ehrgeiz packte sie, ihren Pachthof zu bestellen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9acfb3f4-b2ed-4c9f-8f2a-a4dfdabb1bdd",
                        "source_entry_id": "4fb1768c-edc7-3672-9ee8-022e20ba1f7e",
                        "source_sense_id": "0044d3f9-1824-34dc-b853-ee1282889983",
                        "target_lang_word": "ambition",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ambition",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "39a41110-2457-34eb-883d-4e13d0336689",
                                        "entry_id": "2dd2e9fc-9766-3d53-b52f-6906f33b4987",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Recherche d’honneurs, de gloire, d’élévation sociale, de distinction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0e9478e-3729-401d-a8fd-d793e11178a6",
                                                "sense_id": "39a41110-2457-34eb-883d-4e13d0336689",
                                                "text": "De nos jours, les troupes nombreuses et les armées puissantes […] contribuent à la sûreté des États: elles contiennent l'ambition des princes voisins; ce sont des épées nues qui tiennent celles des autres au fourreau."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da9b0151-3c49-4f6e-94e2-369290aafbbb",
                                                "sense_id": "39a41110-2457-34eb-883d-4e13d0336689",
                                                "text": "Dans Thomas l’imposteur, il avait combiné à une apparence de psychologie « rudimentaire » des aperçus ou constats très fins et pénétrants, dépatinant les sentiments les plus convenus (amour, plaisir, ambition), les sortant du lieu commun."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edbfe0b5-1ebb-425f-a64e-818b6a6369f9",
                                                "sense_id": "39a41110-2457-34eb-883d-4e13d0336689",
                                                "text": "Le comte s'excusa très franchement d'avoir la moindre pensée d'ambition personnelle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be871580-8e72-4914-a9d0-c35654c379f6",
                                                "sense_id": "39a41110-2457-34eb-883d-4e13d0336689",
                                                "text": "Soutenu par des savants, il intrigua auprès du Ministre de la Marine pour obtenir un navire et un équipage qui lui permettraient de satisfaire son ambition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2edd2b5-afe3-4683-869a-3ae9852d9db9",
                                                "sense_id": "39a41110-2457-34eb-883d-4e13d0336689",
                                                "text": "Une faiblesse, cependant : son ambition démesurée, qui tourne à la mégalomanie. Il se rêve à la Chambre, au gouvernement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13942965-f2c6-455e-865b-de0950b7cebd",
                                                "sense_id": "39a41110-2457-34eb-883d-4e13d0336689",
                                                "text": "Moi j’en ai rien à foutre d'être quelqu'un. Je suis un mec sans ambition. Moi mon bonheur, c'est la pêche et le pastaga. Tu vois, ça va pas chercher bien loin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a29fef5f-4e67-3352-ad28-ce69d76da336",
                                        "entry_id": "2dd2e9fc-9766-3d53-b52f-6906f33b4987",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Motivation pour améliorer une situation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ab9c613-ba5a-4238-9968-905fffb64d8e",
                                                "sense_id": "a29fef5f-4e67-3352-ad28-ce69d76da336",
                                                "text": "Il adapta ses ambitions à des considérations plus terre à terre comme trouver un petit boulot pour se nourrir."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
